WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.020
Two a.m. Your agent is still working.

2
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:06.470
Relax. It was in a box.

3
00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:12.100
Meet box. A box for your AI.

4
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:18.860
Every command runs in a fresh microVM,
with its own kernel. Nothing outside changes.

5
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.510
Fast enough to forget it's there.

6
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:29.240
Let it try three things, and keep one.
Your agent can fork. Only you can apply.

7
00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:32.180
It plugs into the agent you already use.

8
00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:35.380
Zero escapes. Run the tests yourself.

9
00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:37.910
box. A box for your AI.
